  - transactive energy
  - OWL 2
  - SPARQL
  - semantic reasoning
abstract: >
  A populated knowledge graph for the SHIFT Ontology (Semantic Hierarchy for
  Intelligent Flexibility and Trading), together with a reproducible synthetic
  instance generator, an executable SPARQL rule set derived from the SHIFT-RR
  rule specifications, and an evaluation harness reporting per-rule correctness
  against an independent oracle and rule-evaluation latency across graph scales.
  All instance data is synthetic. This artefact records no measured deployment.
